\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dollar Steady; Players Watch For  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2006\par 09:11\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                          Latest   Change \par    USD/SGD               1.5426   -0.0015 \par    Overnight rate        3.00%    unch \par    Two-year bond yield:  2.97%    -2bps \par    10-year bond yield:   3.02%    +1bp \par    Two-year swap offer:  3.41%    +1bp \par    10-year swap offer:   3.36%    +1bp \par    2-10-yr swap curve:   -5bps    unch \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar traded in a tight range Thursday, and markets will continue to balance bearish U.S. dollar sentiment against the probability of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , traders say.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 "We should see the U.S. dollar going toward S$1.5400, but there's some possibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming in anywhere below" current levels, said a trader at a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore advocates a modest and gradual appreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the unit within an undisclosed, trade-weighted band.  \par \par \uc2 According to analysts, the trade-weighted Singapore dollar is in the upper half of the policy band, but is weaker than when the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last week.  \par \par \uc2 In the local debt market, trading was quiet on light volume after U.S. Treasurys failed to offer direction, but traders say flows into Singapore dollars may impose downward pressure on yields in comings sessions.  \par \par \uc2 "Buyers of the Singapore dollar may continue to keep (government bond) prices supported," said a trader at a local bank.  \par \par \uc2 The interest rate swap market also reflected the uneventful fixed-income session overnight, but modest demand for floating-rate exposure drove levels slightly higher.  \par \par \uc2 "There was some paying interest in the two-year this morning," a trader at foreign bank said.  \par \par \uc2 -By John Jannarone, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4152; john.jannarone@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Graham Norris [ 30-11-06 0811GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1163 1859  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061130e2bu000zu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
