 those data move the market in the US, one would expect more trading activity tomorrow in Singapore bonds," the said. -By Aaron Back, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4157; aaron.back@dowjones.com -Edited by Graham Norris -0-   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020061128e2bs0030e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
